<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">CC all Insperity partners to make sure they are aware of the change</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Client Name]</span>,&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>As part of the Insperity Service Model, we periodically review the complexity and strategic needs of our clients to ensure the correct resources are aligned. The Business Team consists of HR professionals dedicated to serving clients of your size and business needs. In keeping with Insperity's goal to provide clients with the highest quality service, we will be transferring you to the Business Team service team effective <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[insert date</span>].</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>Insperity's experienced HR service professionals are dedicated to guiding and supporting your business objectives to help your organization achieve improved performance, productivity, and profitability.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>As part of this transition, <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[insert name</span>] will be your dedicated Insperity HR Specialist and Client Liaison on the <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Western/SW/Central/Eastern]</span> Business Team.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>You can reach your new dedicated service team member directly at:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);"><b>BT HRS Contact Name&nbsp;</b></span></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">BT HRS Contact Info</span>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>For excellent HR on-demand service, you will also have access to a toll-free number and email address to connect with the entire [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">Western/SW/Central/Eastern]</span> Business Team: [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">BT Contact Line</span>] and <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[BT Email</span>].&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>I've met with [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">insert name]</span> and discussed all recent and past activity to ensure a smooth transition. We remain committed to providing ongoing support to address any future needs or concerns you may have.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>It has been a pleasure assisting you with your business needs. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to let me know.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]&nbsp;</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>